00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.520
<b>Ep.16</b>

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.520
<b>Ep.16</b>

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.520
<b>Enter The Ultra-Pompadour</b>

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:05.520
<b>Enter The Ultra-Pompadour</b>

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.250
<b>Horohoro's suddenly acting all grown up.</b>

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.840
<b>I don't know what happened,
but it's a good thing.</b>

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:13.090
<b>So maybe you should ease up on him...</b>

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:14.460
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:19.010
<b>His strange smugness really gets to me.</b>

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.430
<b>It's weird</b>

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:23.180
<b>But I don't mind.</b>

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:28.390
<b>Hey, guys</b>

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:31.310
<b>We're almost there</b>

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.710
<b>The place Lilirara pointed to</b>

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.610
<b>The old Patch village, Mesa Verdede</b>

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:45.290
<b>We might find an important clue here.</b>

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.160
<b>I'm getting excited.</b>

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.790
<b>All right, let's check it out</b>

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:55.960
<b>It's full of tourists!</b>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.670
<b>It's the perfect tourist attraction</b>

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.130
<b>What the hell's going on?</b>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:04.640
<b>I say the chance of
finding clues are very slim.</b>

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.390
<b>We came all the way here,
let's just have a look around.</b>

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.310
<b>Yeah, we might still find something</b>

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.530
<b>Keep out?</b>

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.940
<b>Alright, let's go in</b>

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:20.900
<b>Hey!</b>

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.320
<b>Hey, you guys.</b>

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:27.950
<b>If you really want to go in,
perhaps you can come with us.</b>

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.450
<b>These guys...</b>

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.500
<b>Look closely</b>

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:34.460
<b>I've seen these faces before</b>

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:37.500
<b>Hao's minions!</b>

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.550
<b>What?</b>

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.050
<b>Hao...</b>

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.800
<b>Calm down, Lyserg</b>

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.810
<b>What do you guys want?</b>

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.980
<b>Well then...</b>

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.270
<b>Interesting</b>

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.610
<b>What is it?</b>

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.320
<b>Nothing, forgive us</b>

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:03.860
<b>Your resemblance to Hao-sama is striking,
you're obviously a descendant of his.</b>

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.030
<b>What?</b>

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.870
<b>Boss Yoh is...?</b>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.580
<b>Hao's descendant?</b>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:10.750
<b>Oh...</b>

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.670
<b>I already thought we looked alike!</b>

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:14.900
<b>So chill!</b>

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.460
<b>Will somebody please explain this to me?!</b>

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.630
<b>Oops, I'm sorry but you'll have to excuse us</b>

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:26.720
<b>An order of Hao-sama, he wants
Yoh-sama to experience a severe trial.</b>

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:30.970
<b>So we're going to kill his 4 friends.</b>

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.570
<b>You bastard! What did you do to my Lyserg?!</b>

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.570
<b>You filthy pervert!</b>

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:48.120
<b>Behind you, ugly one.</b>

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.080
<b>How...</b>

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:01.250
<b>How very fragile you are.</b>

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:07.510
<b>Allow me to introduce my guardian ghost.
The Vampire hunter, Blaumro.</b>

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:11.890
<b>And I am Boris Tepes Dracula</b>

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.520
<b>A Vampire</b>

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.940
<b>A vampire hunter and Dracula?!</b>

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:17.940
<b>Come on!</b>

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.900
<b>Dracula's a fictional character!</b>

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:25.450
<b>That guy looks more like Dracula than you!</b>

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:30.120
<b>Hey, you're right!
He even has the horns and the mustache.</b>

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:34.270
<b>There's only five of you and
you still have overlapping characters.</b>

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.040
<b>Unforgivable!</b>

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:42.920
<b>To be equated with that
miserable creature! So humiliating!</b>

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.090
<b>What?</b>

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.550
<b>Now there will be no more confusion</b>

00:05:53.260 --> 00:05:56.020
<b>Forgive me, Damayaji</b>

00:05:56.770 --> 00:06:01.110
<b>It's all their fault for humiliating me.</b>

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:07.450
<b>My friend, live on inside me
and join your powers to mine.</b>

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.240
<b>For all eternity.</b>

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.580
<b>What the hell?</b>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:20.630
<b>They just lost one of their
own and they're not even fazed.</b>

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.460
<b>Sorry, it's a failing of mine.</b>

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.090
<b>I get all caught
up in the moment.</b>

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:29.840
<b>Don't worry, we don't
need any weaklings.</b>

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.380
<b>But you'll have to do
his share of the fighting.</b>

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.640
<b>Yoh-kun...</b>

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:36.890
<b>Lyserg!</b>

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:38.810
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.770
<b>I'm so cold...</b>

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.270
<b>I think I'm going to pass out.</b>

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:50.320
<b>Those who are bitten by a vampire,
will become a vampire and my minion.</b>

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.780
<b>Huh? What are you talking about?</b>

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:56.950
<b>Dracula can't walk around in
the middle of the day like this guy.</b>

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.120
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.560
<b>Don't talk as if you know
anything about our secrets!</b>

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>How can mere sunlight reduce
a creature such as me to ashes?</b>

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:12.050
<b>How can eyes burn out
simply by looking at a cross?</b>

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:17.100
<b>Don't be confused by silly human fiction.</b>

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.980
<b>Now I will silence your insolent tongue.</b>

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.400
<b>You were looking the
wrong way, you pig.</b>

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.660
<b>I'm the one you're going to fight.</b>

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:33.820
<b>Ryu!</b>

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.620
<b>This one's mine, Horohoro</b>

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:38.700
<b>I'm extremely annoyed right now.</b>

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:44.040
<b>Maybe this guy is Dracula and
Maybe Boss Yoh is related to Hao.</b>

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.480
<b>But that doesn't matter</b>

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:52.380
<b>I'll never forgive these people for hurting my friends.</b>

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:56.390
<b>Boss, look after Lyserg.</b>

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:07.570
<b>I'm sorry, but today Ryu of the
wooden sword is taking the lead.</b>

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.160
<b>Sorry for the delay</b>

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.660
<b>We'll be in Duringo in about an hour</b>

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:15.780
<b>Manta-sama</b>

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.330
<b>It's remarkable that you persuaded
your father to visit America.</b>

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:26.250
<b>Yeah and I was surprised
Anna-san asked me to bring her too.</b>

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.040
<b>A Shaman Fight, eh?</b>

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:31.900
<b>You explained it so many
times, but I still don't understand.</b>

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.260
<b>I'm not surprised</b>

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:38.930
<b>It's because we live in times like
these that Shamans are needed.</b>

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:43.480
<b>And that's why I have to see this fight.</b>

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.690
<b>On your feet, you conceited pig.</b>

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:53.360
<b>Ah, he shouldn't have done that.</b>

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.280
<b>Now he won't be
allowed a normal death.</b>

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:58.220
<b>M-my face...</b>

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:03.160
<b>He defiled my beautiful face</b>

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.250
<b>You filthy human!</b>

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:10.000
<b>This is unforgivable!</b>

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:15.130
<b>If you like getting hit in the
face, I can keep it up all day.</b>

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.510
<b>And another thing.</b>

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.890
<b>I'm even more deadly with my wooden sword.</b>

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.940
<b>I'm Ryu of the Wooden Sword.
Right, Tokageroh?</b>

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.480
<b>Hell Dragon
Scarlet Lizard!</b>

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.280
<b>And I'll tell you something else</b>

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.910
<b>This guy didn't have the
best upbringing as well.</b>

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.410
<b>He's even badder than I am.</b>

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:50.500
<b>When it comes to being bad, I've
got 600 years of seniority on you.</b>

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.550
<b>So watch how you speak to me.</b>

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.170
<b>Weird</b>

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.340
<b>Is Ryu really that tough?</b>

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.140
<b>Well, since Grandpa trained him...</b>

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:05.390
<b>He's only had one real fight
and that was at Ren's house.</b>

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.180
<b>I see</b>

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:11.810
<b>This Shaman can control
Seirei-class spirits too.</b>

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:18.860
<b>After 600 years a dead person's
soul is freed from it's human shape...</b>

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:22.780
<b>And takes on it's pure form.</b>

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:28.500
<b>You might say it becomes a monster.</b>

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.830
<b>He's flying!</b>

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:34.650
<b>You let your guard down, Boris. Don't
allow the shock to get the better of you.</b>

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.550
<b>I can't die yet</b>

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:41.010
<b>Not before I've delivered
my Dracula family vengeance.</b>

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:44.260
<b>I've seen enough of them already!</b>

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:50.690
<b>I don't care who you are.</b>

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:54.150
<b>Claw or sword, I'll smash 'em.</b>

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.150
<b>Fool</b>

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:01.660
<b>Wh-what?</b>

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.990
<b>I am Boris Tepes Dracula</b>

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.290
<b>Vampire lord.</b>

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.830
<b>It's just as we anticipated</b>

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:17.920
<b>The plan is nearing its
final stage at last, Hao...</b>

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.760
<b>Goldva-sama</b>

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:23.290
<b>Are you sure we should just let him be?</b>

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:28.020
<b>We know that's your your will,
Goldva-sama but he's too dangerous.</b>

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:32.270
<b>He'll repeat that tragedy of 500 years ago!</b>

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:38.570
<b>But whatever happens,
the winner will be the king.</b>

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.530
<b>That's the way of the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.530
<b>What?</b>

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.740
<b>The main competition has already begun.</b>

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:50.830
<b>Only those who make it through the survival
game and reach this place are worthy.</b>

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.750
<b>Bl-Blood!</b>

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.750
<b>Stop drinking it, you bastard!</b>

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:00.800
<b>What?</b>

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.550
<b>They multiplied?</b>

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:06.050
<b>Aaah! I'm being drained!</b>

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.060
<b>Ryu!
Not so fast</b>

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.880
<b>Yoh-dono!</b>

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:13.940
<b>Lyserg, what're you doing?!</b>

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.850
<b>Didn't I already tell you?</b>

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:23.620
<b>Those who are bitten by a vampire,
become vampires themselves.</b>

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.870
<b>Hey, what's going on?</b>

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.040
<b>Blood gives me great power</b>

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:38.790
<b>Hey hold on, he really is a monster!</b>

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.510
<b>I'm outta here!</b>

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.430
<b>Hey, you jerk!
Come back here!</b>

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:49.140
<b>He abandoned his master and fled</b>

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.850
<b>Such is the ways with humans, after all.</b>

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:58.650
<b>That's why I chose to serve
Hao-sama, to exterminate all humans!</b>

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:03.740
<b>Boris is already beyond our control.</b>

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:08.120
<b>Let's go before we get caught up in this.</b>

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:08.980
<b>What?</b>

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.330
<b>Fear not, Yoh-sama</b>

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.120
<b>Even if by some miracle Boris loses...</b>

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:19.630
<b>You will still get to fight us.</b>

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:24.840
<b>Because this road leads to the Patch village</b>

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:27.550
<b>Interesting</b>

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:30.470
<b>In other words, we just have to defeat that monster...</b>

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.180
<b>If we want to move forward.</b>

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:39.190
<b>You can still stand?</b>

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:43.860
<b>You've got to pay for murdering your friend</b>

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:48.820
<b>It's one thing if you were a monster,
But it's worse when you're human!</b>

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.530
<b>You keep talking nonsense</b>

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.580
<b>I know your smell</b>

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.790
<b>You're despised by everyone...</b>

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.460
<b>You lost your home and everything you had!</b>

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:03.130
<b>The smell of sadness!</b>

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.460
<b>You think you and I are alike?</b>

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.010
<b>Don't insult me, human!</b>

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:09.340
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.640
<b>I know I'm right, cause I know your secret!</b>

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:18.730
<b>Bastard!</b>

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:21.400
<b>Hehehe, you thought I fled.</b>

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:25.230
<b>Hey Ryu, his cape is made out of blood</b>

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:35.290
<b>He integrates his guardian ghost
with blood to form that Over Soul cape.</b>

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.880
<b>A Shaman who uses blood as his medium?</b>

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.300
<b>I see</b>

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:53.640
<b>That explains everything</b>

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:58.230
<b>He turns the blood into a vapor,
hides in it, and strikes suddenly.</b>

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.060
<b>So what about Lyserg?</b>

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:04.900
<b>He's being controlled by
his guardian ghost, Blaumro.</b>

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:10.740
<b>My ancestor Vlad Tepes Dracula was human</b>

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:17.290
<b>A hero, who defended his
country against a powerful enemy.</b>

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:22.460
<b>Nevertheless, foolish people
with small nasty hearts...</b>

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:26.590
<b>defamed his memory and
branded him a vampire!</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Kingdom of Hungary</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Kingdom of Hungary</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Transylvania</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Transylvania</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Wallachia</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Wallachia</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Donau river</b>

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:33.870
<b>Donau river</b>

