<b>Vlad was a prince of
the province of Wallachia</b>

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.290
<b>He lived in a time of war and strife</b>

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:40.890
<b>The Ottoman empire kept expanding
and they set foot in Wallachia.</b>

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:48.860
<b>Vlad repelled his hordes by means of a terrible
strategy and became the hero of his nation.</b>

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:54.110
<b>But that ultimately brought
disaster upon our family.</b>

00:15:55.320 --> 00:16:02.080
<b>When the Ottoman empire marched into
Wallachia, they came upon 20,000 impaled Turks.</b>

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:08.170
<b>This brilliant strategy
inspired an infamous name</b>

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.820
<b>"The Impaler Prince"</b>

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.680
<b>People feared Vlad and
in the end they killed him.</b>

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:20.020
<b>And thus those disgusting legends were born.</b>

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:25.060
<b>"Vlad Tepes is a blood thirsty vampire"</b>

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:32.030
<b>My family was forced to flee our ancestral
home and hide in the forests of Transylvania.</b>

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.490
<b>But our struggle didn't end there</b>

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:40.660
<b>In the name of Justice,
fame-seeking men hunted us.</b>

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:45.540
<b>Do you understand now? That
fool over there was one of them!</b>

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.380
<b>Vampire hunter, Blaumro.</b>

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:58.680
<b>We were unable to defend
ourselves against the armed men.</b>

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:04.440
<b>Then one day, having heard tales
of vampires, a man came to us.</b>

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:09.110
<b>I know as well as anyone
what fools people are.</b>

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:13.440
<b>Why not fight back by
becoming real vampires?</b>

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.070
<b>Don't you want to get revenge on them?</b>

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:23.370
<b>Hao-sama granted us hope in
the form of shamanic powers!</b>

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:25.000
<b>Hao?</b>

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:29.630
<b>We swore then, that we would
serve Hao-sama for eternity.</b>

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:33.750
<b>Until the petty foolish humans are exterminated!</b>

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.010
<b>Fight!</b>

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:40.680
<b>Blood makes my powers grow stronger</b>

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:47.140
<b>With these scarlet skewers made from
the blood of fools, I will impale you all!</b>

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:53.730
<b>Naturally, I expect no resistance</b>

00:17:54.150 --> 00:18:00.120
<b>If you make the slightest move, this boy
will impale his own throat with the sword.</b>

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:06.080
<b>It's no good, Lyserg is
completely possessed.</b>

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:09.580
<b>One wrong move and he'll
stab himself with Harusame.</b>

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.920
<b>But if we don't move, we get stabbed</b>

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.590
<b>We're in trouble</b>

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.550
<b>I'm sorry, but could
you be quiet, Yoh-sama?</b>

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.060
<b>My spirit ally is only
possessing the boy's blood.</b>

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:31.810
<b>My Over Soul is at its full power without
being affected by the boy's limitations.</b>

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.780
<b>Blaumro will never loosen his grip</b>

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:39.990
<b>As punishment for the crimes
he committed against my family...</b>

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:45.990
<b>He was tortured until his sense of
right and wrong was utterly destroyed.</b>

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.540
<b>You enslaved his ghost?</b>

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:55.590
<b>Please don't use such mundane terms,
enslaving ghosts is what all shamans do.</b>

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:59.260
<b>Hehehe how pathetic</b>

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:04.390
<b>If you would simply
abandon them to their fates...</b>

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:09.020
<b>You could go on living
very well without them.</b>

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.600
<b>Such weakness if unforgivable</b>

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:16.730
<b>Taste the suffering my family experienced
after you humans robbed them of their home.</b>

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:20.200
<b>Accept this execution.</b>

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:21.840
<b>Say your prayers</b>

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:26.290
<b>When this sword falls, you'll all be dead.</b>

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:28.540
<b>Shit...</b>

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:29.910
<b>Yoh-dono!</b>

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.920
<b>I got it, the problem's an easy one.</b>

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:39.800
<b>Don't worry, that's
why we'll make it.</b>

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:42.460
<b>"That's why"?</b>

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.390
<b>That's why?!</b>

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:48.180
<b>You mean that's why you're dead!</b>

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:51.140
<b>Death by impalement!</b>

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.860
<b>Sheesh, I don't have enough hair</b>

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.360
<b>Step aside, Ryu</b>

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.530
<b>I'll turn those frickin'
skewers into icicles.</b>

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.780
<b>Or better yet, crushed ice!</b>

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.410
<b>Why?! Don't you care
what happens to your friend?</b>

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.450
<b>That's not enough, Horohoro</b>

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:19.090
<b>You've got to pulverize them
so they can never regenerate.</b>

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.840
<b>Super Golden Chinese Slash Dance!</b>

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.640
<b>Impossible impossible impossible!</b>

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.850
<b>What are they thinking?!</b>

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:33.850
<b>It doesn't matter anymore,
stab him in the throat!</b>

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.020
<b>What's going on?!</b>

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.140
<b>I told you to strike, can't
you hear me Blaumro?!</b>

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.530
<b>It's no use</b>

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.700
<b>My words have rekindled his conscience.</b>

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:50.330
<b>He won't listen to you anymore</b>

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:54.960
<b>But why, why did you...?</b>

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.710
<b>Because we're friends</b>

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:03.760
<b>We've been together for a long time.</b>

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:08.100
<b>We knew what Boss Yoh wanted us to do.</b>

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:11.560
<b>I used to be a ghost
enslaving Shaman like you.</b>

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:16.520
<b>But ghosts have hearts too,
that's why I was defeated by him.</b>

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:22.150
<b>If he had a heart we thought we
might be able to get through to him.</b>

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:26.740
<b>So we made our move to distract you</b>

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:30.620
<b>Meanwhile, I tried
to persuade him.</b>

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:35.460
<b>Fool, If you failed the boy would be dead!</b>

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:38.790
<b>But if we hadn't done
anything, we'd all be dead.</b>

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:43.300
<b>Besides, if Lyserg would be
hurt by us, we would've saved him.</b>

00:21:44.090 --> 00:21:48.590
<b>It's no surprise you can't
understand our actions.</b>

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:52.180
<b>My spirit has more tenacity than yours.</b>

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:59.900
<b>If you give up and choose the path of destruction,
you can never build anything worthwhile!</b>

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:04.150
<b>No matter what happens, I never give up</b>

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.200
<b>You can never have
friends or a best place</b>

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:14.540
<b>Or develop a technique
that'll smash your enemy to pieces!</b>

